summary Update SolidWorks will add Hub on Output (a new part, Hub_m1.25_N17), as its shaft's anchor with RangeSlv splined to it, give RangeSlv its bands in Sleeve_m1.25_N17, change RangeSlv's values (Sleeve_m1.25_N17), and move RangeSlv in H to 55.5 mm and in N to 48 mm and in L to 40.5 mm along Output.
